 "description": "ATMOWeb ( as the part of FTPBrowser interface) provides a graphical browsing, subsetting and retrieval capability for selected ionospheric and atmospheric data. Data can be displayed as time series plots, filtering and scatter plot options are also included for a few spacecraft.  The Space Physics Data Facility (SPDF) is the archive of non-solar data for the Heliospheric Science Division (HSD) at NASA's Goddard Space Flight Center.",
